 "pages": "p.3 (pins), p.5 (ROC), p.8-10 (timing), p.21 (data rates), p.35-36 (frames), p.37 (format), p.39-42 (commands), p.44-45 (register map), p.47-57 (fields); ads131m03.pdf for the commercial parts and the RUK package",
 "notModeled": [
  "analog inputs, PGA gains, input multiplexer (MUXn), phase calibration, offset / gain calibration, DC-block filter and global-chop mode (registers stored only)",
  "word length: only the default 24-bit words are modeled (WLENGTH 16-bit and 32-bit frames are stored only); commands, responses and registers are 16 bits MSB-aligned in each 24-bit word",
  "CRC: input CRC checking (RX_CRC_EN), the output CRC word (shifted as zeros) and the register-map CRC (REGMAP_CRC reads 0)",
  "multi-register RREG / WREG (nnn nnnn > 0): one register per command (registers in separate 24-bit words cannot be expressed)",
  "LOCK / UNLOCK interface lock (acknowledged, not enforced)",
  "STATUS mirror bits (CRC_TYPE, RESET, WLENGTH follow MODE) and STATUS.RESET / MODE.RESET clearing; STATUS.LOCK, F_RESYNC, REG_MAP, CRC_ERR stay 0",
  "SYNC/RESET pin: synchronization pulses and the >= 2048 tCLKIN reset pulse (not modeled: a short sync pulse must not reset the registers)",
  "CLKIN / crystal clock: conversion times are at the nominal 8.192 MHz high-resolution clock (data rate = fCLKIN / 2 / OSR); PWR power modes; channel enables CHn_EN (all channels always output)",
